<ui:UXML xmlns:ui="UnityEngine.UIElements" xmlns:uie="UnityEditor.UIElements" xsi:schemaLocation="UnityEngine.UIElements ../../UIElementsSchema/UnityEngine.UIElements.xsd" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" editor-extension-mode="False">
    <Style src="project:/Assets/UI/Styles/GlobalStyles.uss" />
    <ui:VisualElement class="glass-panel" style="flex-direction: row; align-items: center; padding: 15px; margin-bottom: 10px; border-radius: 15px;">
        <!-- Rank -->
        <ui:Label name="rank-label" text="1" style="font-size: 48px; -unity-font-style: bold; color: white; width: 90px; -unity-text-align: middle-center;" />

        <!-- Avatar (sử dụng AvatarHelper) -->
        <ui:VisualElement name="avatar" class="avatar-ring" style="width: 80px; height: 80px; margin-right: 20px; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border-radius: 40px; overflow: hidden;">
            <ui:Label name="avatar-text" text="A" style="font-size: 48px; -unity-font-style: bold; color: white;" />
        </ui:VisualElement>

        <!-- Name -->
        <ui:Label name="name-label" text="PlayerName" style="font-size: 44px; -unity-font-style: bold; color: white; flex-grow: 1;" />

        <!-- Points -->
        <ui:VisualElement style="align-items: flex-end;">
            <ui:Label name="points-label" text="1500" style="font-size: 48px; -unity-font-style: bold; color: #FFD700;" />
            <ui:Label name="points-text" text="Diem" style="font-size: 24px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);" />
        </ui:VisualElement>
    </ui:VisualElement>
</ui:UXML>
